{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/4080","id":2996261052,"node_id":"I_kwDOGiE5WM6yl1C8","number":4080,"title":"validator() form parsing and c.req.parseBody have different behavior","user":{"login":"atoko","id":1724279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko","html_url":"https://github.com/atoko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-04-15T12:28:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T06:27:39Z","closed_at":"2025-04-17T06:27:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hello Hono team,\n\nI found a small gap when trying to use `validator()` to parse a dot encoded FormData. Small example:\n```html\n<form>\n   <input name=\"survey_id\" />\n   <input name=\"person.firstname\" />\n   <input name=\"person.lasname\" />\n</form>\n```\n\n\nCurrently `validator` doesn't support dot notation at all [validator.ts](https://github.com/honojs/hono/blob/b68da3945e23f0ddef8878b08df3a359eeef4a75/src/validator/validator.ts#L108)\n\nI'm having to do this manually:\n```typescript\nconst body = structuredClone(await c.req.parseBody({ dot: true })) ?? {};\nconst form =\n\tawait MyObjZodSchema.safeParseAsync(body);\nif (form.success) {\n    // form.data should be { survey_id?: string; person?: { firstname?: string; lastname?: string } }\n}\n```\n\nIt would be nice to support c.req.valid for these cases, but I don't want to break existing form users. Either way is fine, may I suggest `formbody` or `formparse` target?\n\nAnother thing to note is that Zod isn't able to parse the result of `c.req.parseBody`, so I used `structuredClone`. I'm assuming it's due to how the object is constructed (no prototype), so it needs to be cloned before going to Zod.\n\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"atoko","id":1724279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko","html_url":"https://github.com/atoko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atoko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4080/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}